        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, this wasn’t bad at all! Chokepoint went down on Idealist’s 3rd turn.<br>\nTIL Silver Gulch has a gold mine, too! Does that place it in or near California? I don’t recall many locations being nailed down other than Megalopolis in Connecticut and Insula Primalis somewhere within the Arctic Circle.</p>",
